---
import VaultLayout from "../../layouts/VaultLayout.astro";
---

<VaultLayout title="The Vault" subtitle="An encyclopaedia of vintage computing" summary="People, chips, techniques, companies, timelines — the living context behind the lessons.">
  <!-- 📷 suggested: collage of magazines, chips, and cassette inlays -->

  <p>
    Welcome to <strong>The Vault</strong> — short, reference‑style entries that connect the hands‑on lessons to their cultural and technical roots. Browse features, follow cross‑links, and fall down some glorious rabbit holes.
  </p>

  <h2>Featured</h2>
  <div class="vault-grid">
    <a href="/vault/bedroom-coder" class="vault-card">
      <span class="vault-kicker">Culture</span>
      <span class="vault-name">The Rise of the Bedroom Coder</span>
      <span class="vault-blurb">How kids with cassette decks built an industry.</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/vault/vic-ii" class="vault-card">
      <span class="vault-kicker">Hardware</span>
      <span class="vault-name">Inside the VIC‑II</span>
      <span class="vault-blurb">Sprites, scrolling, and the C64’s signature look.</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/vault/cassette-loading" class="vault-card">
      <span class="vault-kicker">Technique</span>
      <span class="vault-name">How a Cassette Becomes a Game</span>
      <span class="vault-blurb">From magnetic stripes to moving sprites.</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2>Browse by theme</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Culture:</strong> <a href="/vault/bedroom-coder">Bedroom coders</a>, <a href="/vault/zzap64">Zzap!64</a>, <a href="/vault/crash-magazine">CRASH</a>, <a href="/vault/demo-scene-101">Demo Scene 101</a></li>
    <li><strong>Hardware:</strong> <a href="/vault/commodore-64">Commodore 64</a>, <a href="/vault/zx-spectrum">ZX Spectrum</a>, <a href="/vault/vic-ii">VIC-II</a>, <a href="/vault/sid-chip">SID</a></li>
    <li><strong>Techniques:</strong> <a href="/vault/raster-tricks-101">Raster tricks</a>, <a href="/vault/disk-fastloaders">Disk fastloaders</a>, <a href="/vault/kernal-io">KERNAL I/O</a></li>
    <li><strong>People &amp; studios:</strong> <a href="/vault/jeff-minter">Jeff Minter</a>, <a href="/vault/andrew-braybrook">Andrew Braybrook</a>, <a href="/vault/oliver-twins">The Oliver Twins</a>, <a href="/vault/hewson-consultants">Hewson Consultants</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Recently added</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/vault/commodore-64">Commodore 64</a></li>
    <li><a href="/vault/sid-chip">SID: The Sound of the C64</a></li>
    <li><a href="/vault/fairlight-group">Fairlight (Demo Group)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/vault/crash-magazine">CRASH Magazine</a></li>
    <li><a href="/vault/attack-of-the-mutant-camels">Attack of the Mutant Camels</a></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="note">
    <div class="note-title">Contribute</div>
    Have sources, scans, or stories to add? Open a pull request or get in touch — The Vault grows with your expertise.
  </div>

  <style>
    .vault-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-3);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    }
    .vault-card {
      display: block;
      padding: var(--space-4);
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--color-text);
      transition: transform var(--transition-base), box-shadow var(--transition-base), border-color var(--transition-base);
    }
    .vault-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border-color: var(--color-primary);
    }
    .vault-kicker {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    }
    .vault-name {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    }
    .vault-blurb {
      display: block;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .note { margin-top: var(--space-6); }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .vault-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</VaultLayout>
